Annotation(dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>)
Annotation(rdfs:comment "Based on CARO 1.0, with modifications and additions by David Osumi-Sutherland, Chris Mungall, Ramona Walls and Melissa Haendel.")

