AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CARO_0000012> "Anatomical structure that is an individual member of a clade and, at some point in its life-cycle, consists of more than one cell.")
