AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000447> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0064792") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000449> "A cell that is a progenitor of the adult midgut and is part of the embryonic/larval midgut. These cells occupy a basal position in the midgut epithelium and divide twice during larval stages to form clusters of four cells called midgut imaginal islands.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000449> "AMP")
