AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00000633> "None of the abdominal segments has more than one ventral transverse muscle (see FBrf0089570 == Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997, The embryonic development of Drosophila melanogaster. 2nd ed.)")
