AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001300> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21438012") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001301> "Ventrolaterally located cell body glial cell, located in the lateral cortex more medial to the lateral cell body glial cell. This cell is not present in all animals.")
