AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001370> "Figure 7 of Hartenstein and Campos-Ortega, (1984), graphically depicts the pattern formed by the population of neuroblasts for the left half of the germ band.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0055900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0058118") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0073294") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0084809") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0112030") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.neuro.uoregon.edu/doelab/lineages/NB1-1.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001371> "Neuroblast NB1-1 delaminates at stage 1 and generates the aCC and pCC neurons, glia, interneurons and additional motorneurons in the thoracic segments (http://www.neuro.uoregon.edu/doelab/lineages/NB1-1.html).")
