AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0055900") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0112030") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001382> "Midline precursor cell that divides only once to produce the intersegmental interneurons dMP2 and vMP2 neurons. Despite its name, it forms bilaterally as part of the medial column of stage1 neuroblasts (Schmid et al., 1999).")
