AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0112030") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.neuro.uoregon.edu/doelab/lineages/NB4-1.html") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.neuro.uoregon.edu/doelab/lineages/texts/41 description.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001397> "Neuroblast NB4-1 delaminates at S3 in the medial column. It produces the putative motorneuron of the transverse nerve (FBbt:00001996) and a variety of intersegmental and local interneurons.")
