AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0048551") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001587> "Serotonergic neuron whose cell body is located in one of 2 (bilateral) clusters in the brain: in the larva these clusters occupy the ventral cortex (rind) adjacent to the esophagus aperture; in the adult they are located in the cortex of the inferior-medial protocerebrum.")
