AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001856> "Duct that arises from invagination from the maxillary and intercalary segments and runs between the dorsal pouch and the pharynx. It's ventral arm serves as a muscle attachment site for the ventral pharyngeal muscles (VPM 1-3).")
