AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001857> "Editing Flag: This probably needs fixing. There seem to be two different things referred to as a dorsal pouch. One is a transitional structure formed during development of the head, and the other is an unrelated larval structure. Need to disambiguate/disentangle. Note - possible redundancy between primordium term and embryonic term. ds060616.")
