AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0064788") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0064803") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001863> "Protuberance of the procephalon that marks the rudimentary third (intercalary) head segment (Hartenstein, 1993). It first becomes apparent at stage 11 of embryogenesis. This lobe bears the primordium of the hypopharyngeal organ (Jurgens and Hartenstein, 1993).")
