AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001916> "Expression of Period was determined by per-lacZ fusion expression (Kaneko et al., 1997).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0098279") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001917> "Period (FBgn0003068) expressing neuron whose soma is located in the larval brain cortex in a cluster dorso-anterior to the DN2 cluster. Expression of Period in this cell does not show circadian cycling.")
