AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001953> "May be precursor of medial-most part of the lobula complex (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0052913") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0064800") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00001954> "A lateral zone of proliferating neuroblasts arising from the central part of the inner optic anlage near the Bolwig's nerve. Neuroblasts segregate from the anlage at the beginning of the third larval instar, and are displaced towards the point of entry of the Bolwig's nerve and then separate from each other by newly formed fiber bundles (\"Zellenstrange\"). One group will form the central plug, and the distal group are pushed up against the posterior face of the lamina surrounding the Bolwig's nerve.")
