AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002030> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002030> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#hidden_assertion>)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0148966") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.normalesup.org/~vorgogoz/FlyPNS/PNSdescription0.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002031> "Multidendritic neuron ventrally located in the lateral complex of the second and third thoracic segments of the larva. Its long and sinuous dendrites are simply branched, but are symmetrically bifurcating.")
