AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0075005") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002180> "Abdominal transverse nerve that exits the ventral nerve cord at a dorsomedial position, splits into a left and right branch and extends ventrally along the segment boundary (Gorczyca et al., 1994). Formed by the axons of the abdominal abdominal intersegmental bidendritic neuron (isbp) and the abdominal intersegmental trachea-associated neuron (istd) (Campos-Ortega, J.A., Hartenstein, V.,1997).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0075005") <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002180> "TN")
