AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002427> "Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997, have this labelled as a tracheal dendritic neuron 'ltd' - but analysis in Grueber et al., 2002, shows this to be a class III da neuron. The name ltd is also sometimes used as a synonym for istd, an unrelated tracheal dendritic neuron found near the anterior segment boundary of A1-7.")
