AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0148966") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.normalesup.org/~vorgogoz/FlyPNS/PNSdescription.html#ldaA") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002434> "Multidendritic neuron in the lateral sensory cluster of larval abdominal segments 1-7. Based on its dendritic pattern, it is a class II dendritic arborizing neuron.")
