AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002434> "Disambiguation - there is a multidendritic neuron of the lateral sensory cluster of T2 and T3 with the name ldaA (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997), but this likely reflects a naming coincidence rather than indicating they should be classified with the ldaA neurons of A1-7.")
