AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002687> "Schmidt-Ott et al., (1994) tentatively assign this to the mandibular segment on the basis of its fasciculation pattern. This evidence is much weaker than the genetic evidence they use to determine the segmental identity of other head sensilla.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002688> "Sensillum of the lateral fold of the dorsal pouch. It contains 2 or 3 sensory neurons.")
