AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.normalesup.org/~vorgogoz/FlyPNS/PNSdescription.html#lch1") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00002823> "Monoscolopidial chordotonal organ of the lateral sensory cluster of larval segments A1-7. There is one of these organs per cluster. It is innervated by the abdominal v'ch1 neuron.")
