AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0007735") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0064793") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003362> "An indirect flight muscle that functions as a wing depressor. The six pairs of dorsal medial muscles function to depress the wings by longitudinal arching of the scutum (Miller, 1950).")
