AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0193849") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003631> "DN (dorsal Period-expressing neuron of adult brain) with a cell body located in the lateral-most cluster of Period expressing DN neurons. There are around 40 cells in each cluster.")
