AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003655> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003655> "Sites inferred to be presynaptic by localization of fluorescently tagged synaptobrevin and to be post-synaptic by localization of fluorescently tagged DSCAM (Young and Armstrong, 2010).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049409") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003656> "Extrinsic ring neuron that arborizes with blebs in the posterior of the ellipsoid body. It branches in the median protocerebrum.")
