AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:SPR") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/terms/terms.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003664> "A neuron arborizing exclusively within a given neuropil domain. Intrinsic (local) interneurons may be ipsilateral, restricted to one of side of a paired neuropil domain, or bilateral, extending a process across the midline and arborizing in both sides of a pair of bilaterally symmetric neuropil domains.")
