AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003667> "From Strausfeld (ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7) pg 83,79 in Musca Domestica. Confirmed as present in Drosophila melanogaster by VH.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049409") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "VFB_vol:00003668") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/frontschem3.html") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/sagschem1.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003668> "A row of 16 connected glomeruli (8 on each side of the midline) that forms a dorso-posteriorly located part of the central complex embedded in the cortex between the calyces of the two mushroom bodies.")
