AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:BrainName") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "VFB_vol:00003748") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/atlas/schematic/frontschem2.html") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://flybrain.neurobio.arizona.edu/Flybrain/html/terms/terms.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003748> "The second optic neuropil, sandwiched between the lamina and the lobula complex. It is divided into 10 layers: Layers 1-6 make up the outer medulla, and the seventh (or serpentine) layer exhibits a distinct architecture. Proximal to this, layers 8-10 make up the inner medulla.")
