AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003773> "Distal medullary amacrine neuron that branches extensively at the distal surface of the medulla forming a broad arbor with each branch making a distinctive bleb-type terminal in M1 from which short, fine terminal branches project.")
