AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003774> "Distal medullary amacrine neuron that branches in layer M6. The branches spread along the layer, forming an arbor in M6 with terminals of mixed morphology. Some collaterals from this arbor extend to M4 where they also spread to form an arbor with terminals of mixed morphology.")
