AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0213020") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003776> "Medullary intrinsic neuron with bushy, fine arborizations in medulla layers M1 and M5, coinciding with the arborization domains of lamina monopolar neuron M1. The projection of this neuron branches at the inner-face of the medulla to form two to three varicose recurrent terminal specializations that extend back up to the inner border of layer M8. It is a cholinergic neuron (Varija Raghu et al., 2011).")
