AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003835> "The neurotransmitter was assessed by labelling cells with a vGlut[CNSIII]-Gal4 driver [FBti0129148] (Raghu and Borst, 2011).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003836> "Tangential neuron of the optic lobe that projects and arborizes along the plane of one or more medulla layers.")
