AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003837> "Neuron with a giant projection that extends along the serpentine layer sending out collaterals distally that arborize in medulla layer M4 and proximally that arborize in the serpentine layer and in layers M8 and 9.")
