AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003841> "Medullary tangential neuron that extends along the proximal face of the medulla. It shows extensive fine and bleb-like arborizations in medulla layers M8, M9, and M10.")
