AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003845> "Medullary tangential neuron whose axon extends along the proximal side of the medulla, and then extends along the top of the medulla neuropil, only sparing the most posterior part of it. It displays bleb-like terminals throughout the top of medulla layer M1, with a few entering the proximal side of layer M2.")
