AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0213690") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003847> "Medullary tangential neuron that enters the medulla via Cuccatti's bundle at the level of the serpentine layer. It shows bleb-like terminals in the serpentine layer and medulla layer M6. It is a glutamatergic neuron (Raghu and Borst, 2011).")
