AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003866> "A lobula tangential neuron that branches extensively as it enters the lobula in layer 6, with each branch forming a fine, bushy arbor. Together, these arbors cover the whole width of layer 6.")
