AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003868> "A lobula tangential neuron that arborizes throughout lobula layer 1. The dendrites of this neuron frequently form conspicuous loops extending into the second optic chiasm.")
