AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049410") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0155898") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003917> "Giant neuron whose arbor fans out widely over the dorsal, central or ventral part of lobula plate layer 1. The (dendritic) arborization in the lobula plate is flattened in the anterior-posterior axis, and the axon extends medially and ventrally (Scott et al., 2002).")
