AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003920> "The neurotransmitter was assessed by labelling cells with a vGlut[CNSIII]-Gal4 driver [FBti0129148] (Raghu and Borst, 2011).")
