AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:BrainName") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0051437") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0205263") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003984> "Tract branching from the inner antenno-cerebral tract close to the antennal lobe and extending to the lateral horn. Occasionally, fibers leave the middle antenno-cerebral tract halfway and extend along the pedunculus of the mushroom body to the calyx (Stocker, 1990).")
