AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0006611") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0051437") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00003987> "A short axon tract containing only a few fibers which projects from the posterior of the antennal lobe, just ventral to the inner antenno-cerebral tract. Fibers from this tract pass into posterior brain areas, e.g. into the region of the great commissure.")
