AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0042883") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004028> "The ~10um adult labial nerve arises from the ventral side of the subesophageal ganglion. Proximally, it gives off branches to the basiproboscis and haustellum (a branch consisting of ~10 motorneurons (Nayak and Singh, 1983)), and the labellar glands and sense organs (Miller, 1950). The labial nerve is anastomosed with the maxillary nerve until the latter branches off to the maxillary palpus (Nayak and Singh, 1983).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:BrainName") <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004028> "labellar nerve")
