AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004028> "Miller, (1950) considers the maxillary nerve to be a branch of the compound maxillary-labial nerve. More recent studies (e.g. Rajashekhar and Singh (1994), or Nayak and Singh (1983)) consider the maxillary nerve and labial nerve to be separate anastomosing nerves.")
