AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004210> "DISAMBIGUATION: Edwards and Meinertzhagen (2010) argue that the larval subretinal glia are a different cell group to the adult subretinal glial cells, linked only by name. They propose the abolition of the term 'subretinal glial cell' in favour of 2 distinct classes - fenestrated and pseudocartridge glial cells.")
