AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004528> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/fbbt#cur>)
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0007733") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004529> "Fixed, arched, sclerotized plate on the posterior side of the cibarium. It is attached to the clypeus.")
