AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004547> "Ferris, 1950 claims that the hypopharynx does not exist in D.melanogaster, although the salivary stylet is often mistaken for it. It seems likely that the salivary stylet (FBbt:00004547) and the hypopharynx described by Bodenstein, 1950 (FBbt:00003130) are the same structure.")
