AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0007734") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:978-0-8014-8125-3") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00004658> "A small ventral, median sclerite of the pretarsus that is partially invaginated into the end of the 5th tarsal segment and is the attachment site of the attachment of a long tendon connected to the pretarsal depressor muscle.")
