AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0064787") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005050> "Specialized tracheocyte found at tracheal nodes. These cells play a critical role in fragmentation of the tracheal cuticle during moults and in remodelling of the tracheal epithelium during metamorphosis.")
