AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005067> "The fat body primordium after the gonadal sheath primordium splits from it during stage 14. During late embryogenesis, various holes and clefts form, giving the fat body its larval form. The cells of this primordium do not accumulate fat during their differentiation (this only happens in the larval fat body).")
