AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005219> "Scolopale cell (CL:0000382) and scolopidial sheath cell appear to be synonymous.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:15286786") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005220> "A cell type of the cardiogenic mesoderm whose progeny become cardial cells and hemocytes of the lymph gland.")
