AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0036849") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049147") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005347> "Bouyant (approximately 6.5-12 hrs at 25'C). Prepupa floats on water (6.5-7 hours). Other events: lateral trachea become obscured (6.5-8 hours); everted wing and legs discs visible (translucent); bubble appears in posterior of puparium, displacing prepupa anteriorly.")
