AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0036849") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049147") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005348> "Moving bubble/pupation (12-13.5 hours): Bubble within abdomen disappears; posterior bubble gradually displaced to anterior of puparium, while the (pre?)pupa withdraws to posterior end; imaginal head sac everted and mouthparts of larva expelled.")
