AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0036849") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049147") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005351> "Malpighian tubules migrating - enlarged initial segments of anterior pair of Malpighian tubules move from thorax to abdomen. Translucent patch lacking adhering fat body cells becomes apparent in the middle of the eye region.")
