AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0111143") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0152146") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0193849") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005740> "Cholinergic, rhabdomeric photoreceptor cell which is part of the eyelet (Yasuyama and Meinertzhagen, 1999). Eyelet photoreceptors function in entrainment of the circadian clock to photoperiod (Helfrich-Forster et al., 2002). Their axons terminate in the accessory medulla (Helfrich-Forster et al., 2007).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005740> "H-B eyelet photoreceptor")
