AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00005740> "Evidence that this is a cholinergic sensory neuron comes from staining for choline acetyltransferase expression. (Yasuyama and Meinertzhagen, 1999).")
