AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007080> "From Strausfeld (ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7) pg 93 in Musca Domestica. Confirmed as present in Drosophila melanogaster by VH & WP.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:VH") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:978-3-540-07343-7") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007081> "A transverse axon tract in the protocerebrum which is connected to the inferior lateral protocerebrum, the ventro-lateral protocerebrum and inferior medial protocerebrum.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007081> "VFB:FBbt_00007081")
