AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0193012") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007326> "A ventral branch of the intersegmental nerve of segments A1-7. Its branching point is dorsal to that of ISNd. It innervates various ventral somatic muscles including muscles 28, 14 and 12.")
