AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007328> "FBbt:00007328")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007329> "Posteriorly directed ventral branch of segmental nerve of larval A1-7. It innervates the ventral acute musculature muscles and carries axons of the ventral sensory cluster.")
