AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0048551") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0158877") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007339> "Bilaterally paired serotonergic neuron of both larval and adult brain. During larval stages only two are present - each cell body is located in the antero-dorsal cortex and its axon follows a posterior path within the same hemisphere as the cell body. In the adult brain, a cluster of 3 is present in each hemisphere, with cell bodies located in the cortex overlying the anterior medial protocerebrum. Their axons enter the anterior neuropil.")
