AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0128642") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0141649") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187104") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007359> "Olfactory sensillum of antennal segment 3. It resembles antennal segment 3 trichoid sensillum in cuticular morphology, pore structure and dimensions, but, like antennal segment 3 basiconic sensilla, it lacks a basal drum and is innervated by branched dendrites from 2-3 ORNs.")
