AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0137194") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007411> "Largest taste bristle subtype of the labellum: each bristle is around 35 micrometres long. These bristles are located in the region between the intermediate bristles on the lobe periphery and the medial-ventrally located short taste bristles.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007411> "2010-01-06T06:53:45Z")
