AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0054817") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:978-3-540-42590-8") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007423> "A region of the lamina anlage marked by a fold. Like the morphogenetic furrow in the developing eye, this fold progresses from posterior to anterior, reflecting posterior to anterior progression of differentiation.")
