AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0193849") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007431> "DN (dorsal Period-expressing neuron of adult brain) with a medium-sized cell body, located in the lateral-most cluster of per expressing DN neurons. There are two cells per hemisphere, each of which project anteriorly to the aMe (Helfrich-Forster et al., 2007).")
