AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0049409") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0210154") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007527> "Pontine neuron P1 that arborizes in layer 3 of the fan-shaped body. On entering the fan-shaped body, its projection bifurcates, one branch running anteriorly through one segment and arborizing there with spines, the other running along the caudal surface across the midline and sending blebbed endings into a segment that is separated from the ipsilateral segment by half the width of the fan-shaped body.")
