AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0210154") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007533> "Lateral fan-shaped neuron that connects the fan-shaped body and the ellipsoid body.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007533> "djs93")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007533> "2010-10-19T06:02:15Z")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007533> "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007533> "FBbt:00007533")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0210154") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007534> "Extrinsic lateral fan-shaped neuron that projects posteriorly, arborizing in the middle inferior medial protocerebrum and lateral accessory lobe (ventral body), before projecting across the midline to circle around the contralateral side of the ellipsoid body, and innervates the fan-shaped body. Innervation of the lateral accessory lobes is presynaptic, whilst that of the fan-shaped body is postsynaptic. The cell bodies of neurons in this class cluster in the cortex dorsal to the antennal lobes.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007534> "djs93")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007534> "2010-10-19T06:03:21Z")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007534> "fly_anatomy.ontology")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007534> "FBbt:00007534")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0210154") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00007535> "Extrinsic lateral fan-shaped neuron that projects dorso-anteriorly to the posterior superior medial protocerebrum where it forms postsynaptic arborizations prior to forming presynaptic arborizations in the fan-shaped body. The cell bodies of these neurons lie in a cluster lateral to the mushroom body calyx. Arborization in the fan-shaped body spans a whole layer, but within that layer boundaries split the arborization into 16 segments.")
