AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0089570") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00017001> "Primordium of the anterior spiracle of the larva. Originates in the posterior third of the lateral ectoderm of the prothoracic segment during stage 14 as a group of cells that are more basophilic than those surrounding them. It fuses with the tracheal primordium of the mesothoracic segment (tracheal metamere 1).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasAlternativeId> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00017001> "FBbt:00005601")
