AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0064787") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00017003> "Tracheal primordium that develops into the embryonic/larval the embryonic/larval visceral branch. It branches anteriorly from the dorsal portion of the transverse connective primordium during stage 12, coursing anteriorly and inwardly towards the gut.")
