AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00017004> "Candidate for obsoletion as not clear what this might refer to. One possibility is that it corresponds to the ventral region of invaginated tracheal pit. Or it may correspond to the primordium of the lateral trunk (FBbt:00005578).")
