AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0203179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0206335") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0211729") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "doi:10.1371/journal.pbio.1000461.g002") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040000> "Antennal lobe projection neuron from the ad neuroblast lineage whose dendrites innervate only antennal lobe glomerulus DC3. Neurons of this class are derived from the sixth larval division of the antero-dorsal antennal lobe neuroblast (Yu et al., 2010).")
