AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040035> "FBbt:00040035")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040035> "Based on silver staining, Hanesch et al., (1989) claim that there are 6 layers in the fan-shaped body. In more recent work using the synaptic marker Nc82, Young and Armstrong (2010) state that there are 'roughly 8 layers', but note that 'establishing specific layers clearly' can often prove difficult. This ontology currently follows Hanesch.")
