AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:BrainName") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "VFB_vol:00040039") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040039> "A thin, bilaterally paired synaptic neuropil domain that protrudes medially from below the inferior clamp to the area between the great commissure and the central complex. Its medial tip extends towards the noduli.")
