AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040050> "Historically regarded as part of the inferior medial protocerebrum.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:BrainName") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "VFB_vol:00040051") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040051> "Anterior synaptic neuropil domain, below the opening of the esophageal foramen. It lies above the anterior-most area of the subesophageal ganglion and houses the superior pharyngeal sensory center, containing the terminals of peripheral axons from the pharyngeal nerve.")
