AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:BrainName") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "VFB_vol:00040072") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00040072> "Synaptic neuropil domain that is the inferior (ventral) part of the posterior supraesophageal ganglion, covering the area between the inferior bridge and the subesophageal ganglion with its superior part lying behind the ventral complex. It contains extensive arborizations of ascending and descending neurons. Its superior boundary is the level above which such arborizations do not occur. It also contains the terminals of axons from the ocellar ganglia, projecting via the ocellar nerve.")
