AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00045009> "Considering that the Kenyon cell fiber projecting from the calyx divide rather than meet at this point, the term 'pedunculus junction' is somewhat misleading. Similarly, to prevent ambiguity, the terms 'heel' and 'knee' have been avoided as they are also used for referring to the mushroom body spur.")
