AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187305") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18535862") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067000> "Olfactory trichoid sensillum of antennal segment 3 that is innervated by 3 ORNs. It is distinguishable from at4 by its odor response profile (de Bruyne and Baker, 2008) and the identity of the ORNs that innervate it (2a, 19a/b and 43a; Cuoto et al., 2005; de Bruyne and Baker, 2008).")
