AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067009> "Antennal basiconic sensillum ab4 is bidendritic. According to Hallem et al., 2004 (FBrf0179238), adult ORN 43b corresponds to the functionally defined ORN ab8A. We can therefore deduce that adult ORN 9a corresponds to ORN ab8B.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187305") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18535862") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067010> "Olfactory trichoid sensillum of antennal segment 3 that is innervated by 3 ORNs. It is distinguishable from at3 by its odor response profile (de Bruyne and Baker, 2008) and the identity of the ORNs that innervate it (47b, 65a/b/c, 88a; Cuoto et al., 2005; de Bruyne and Baker, 2008).")
