AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067020> "Antennal basiconic sensillum ab4 is bidendritic. According to Hallem et al., 2004 (FBrf0179238), adult ORN 49a corresponds to the functionally defined ORN ab10A. We can therefore deduce that adult ORN 67a corresponds to ORN ab10B.")
