AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067024> "Based on its size and the number of innervating ORNS, this is likely to correspond to LB-I (FBbt:00007355) or LB-II2 (FBbt:00007356) of Shanbhag et al., 1999, but it is not clear which.")
