AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067031> "Work by Fishilevich and Vosshall (FBrf0187306, 2005), suggested that some neurons of the class also innervated glomerulus VA2, but subsequent work showed this result to be an due to expression of the Or67d-Gal4 line used in a different ORN class (FBrf0201681 == Fishilevich and Vosshall, 2007).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187305") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18535862") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067032> "Olfactory trichoid sensillum of antennal segment 3 that is innervated by two ORNs.")
