AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067032> "May be identical to antennal sensillum trichodeum T2 (FBbt:00007348) of Shanbhag et al., 1999.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187305") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067033> "Bilateral olfactory receptor neuron (ORN) that expresses Or23a (FBgn0026395). Its axon branches, with one branch innervating the ipsilateral antennal lobe glomerulus DA3 and the other fasciculating with the antennal commissure and innervating the contralateral antennal lobe glomerulus DA3. Its dendrite transduces signals from antennal trichoid sensillum at2.")
