AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0108493") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187305") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067035> "Basiconic olfactory sensillum of maxillary palp that is innervated by the dendrites of two ORNs. It is distinguishable from pb1 and pb3 by its odor response profile (Goldman et al., 2005) and the identity of the ORNs that innervate it (85e/33c and 46a; Cuoto et al., 2005; Goldman et al., 2005).")
