AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0108493") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187305") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:18535862") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067060> "Thin antennal basiconic sensillum innervated by the dendrites of two ORNs. It is distinguishable from ab5 - ab10 by its odor response profile (De Bruyne et al., 2001) and the identity of the ORNs that innervate it (49b; Cuoto et al., 2005; de Bruyne and Baker, 2008).")
