AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067063> "Antennal basiconic sensillum ab4 is bidendritic. According to Hallem et al., 2004 (FBrf0179238), adult ORN Or7a corresponds to ab4A. We can therefore deduce that adult ORN Or56a corresponds to ORN ab4B.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0051437") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0179739") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187305") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067064> "Ipsilateral odorant receptor neuron that expresses Gr21a (FBgn0041250). It innervates antennal lobe glomerulus V. Unlike many other antennal olfactory receptor neurons, it does not send an axon branch through the antennal commissure to innervate the equivalent contralateral glomerulus. Suh et al., (2004), identify this neuron as being sensitive to CO2 levels.")
