AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0167816") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0191055") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0203179") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0205263") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00067350> "Adult antennal lobe projection neuron that fasciculates with the inner antenno-cerebral tract. There are about 100 of these per tract. Most (all?) of these neurons arborize extensively in the mushroom body calyx, whilst the accessory calyx is free from termini. Most are cholinergic (Yasuyama et al., 2003), but some are GABAergic (Wilson and Laurent, 2005; Jefferis et al, 2007).")
