AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100019> "Presence of presynaptic sites determined by immunoreactivity to syntaxin and synaptobrevin::GFP localization (Kamikouchi et al., 2006). Activation of zone E Johnston organ neurons through aristal deflection determined by GCaMP studies (Yorozu et al., 2009, Kamikouchi et al., 2009).")
