AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0144829") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0190156") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100100> "Photoreceptor cell of the larval Bolwig's organ that expresses the blue-absorbing rhodopsin Rh5 (lambda[max] = 437nm; FBgn0014019). Fibers pass along the larval optic nerve and terminate in the larval optic neuropil where they have been shown to overlap with serotonergic arborizations (Rodriguez Moncalvo and Campos, 2005). There are about 4 of these per Bolwig organ.")
