AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100104> "This bristle is believed to be chemosensory based on the presence of the terminal pore and multiple innervation with dendrites extending to the pore (Palka et al., 1979).")
