AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100114> "FBbt:00100114")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100114> "Murray et al., (1984) state that they do not know if the pioneering twin sensillum of margin 1 neuron is the proximal or distal of the two twin sensilla.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0040724") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100115> "Neuron innervating the twin sensillum of margin 2. This neuron begins axonogenesis at approximately 9-10 hours AP (Murray et al., 1984).")
