AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0040724") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100129> "Neuron located near to the campaniform sensillum L3-2 of wing vein L3 neuron, but does not possess a typical dendrite whose conspicuous distal tip can be seen near the surface of the epithelium (Murray et al., 1984).")
