AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0040724") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100130> "Neuron located near to the neuron innervating the twin sensillum of margin 1 and 2. It does not possess a typical dendrite whose conspicuous distal tip can be seen near the surface of the epithelium (Murray et al., 1984).")
