AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100252> "Via Golgi impregnation and immunostaining, Strausfeld et al., (2003) identifies this highly taurine-immunopositive, aspartate-immunonegative band. However, Tanaka et al., (2008), using an enhancer trap screen, suggest that the neurons composing the alpha''/beta'' lobe should be regarded as a subpopulation of the alpha'/beta' anterior neurons.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0205263") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100253> "A subgroup of the mushroom body alpha'/beta' neurons that mainly innervates the middle stratum of the alpha' and beta' lobes.")
