AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100254> "FBbt:00100254")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100254> "Labelling pattern comparison of the enhancer traps NP65, NP1131, NP6522 and NP7427 prompted the classification of three subpopulations (anterior, middle and posterior) of alpha'/beta' neurons by Tanaka et al., (2008), according to their terminal positions. Comparisons using these enhancer trap lines suggests that the neurons terminating in the posterior of the alpha' lobe are the same subclass as those terminating in the posterior of the beta' lobe.")
