AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FBC:BrainName") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0080339") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100332> "The adult recurrent nerve runs from the frontal ganglion to the separation of the stomodeal and pharyngeal nerves (Rajashekhar and Singh, 1994). It contains fibers of the enteric nervous system.")
