AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0141667") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0146917") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0205814") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0211729") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100368> "An adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron that is derived from the antero-dorsal antennal lobe neuroblast. All of these neurons have axons that fasciculate with the inner antenno-cerebral tract (iACT) and innervate the mushroom body calyx (via a collateral) and the lateral horn.")
