AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100510> "The perineurial glial cells develop post-embryonically (Edwards and Meinertzhagen, 2010).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0191040") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:21438012") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100511> "Glial cell of the embryonic/larval peripheral nervous system that ensheathes axons and dendrites. The perineurial layer of glial cell lie on top of the inner, subperineurial glial cells (Banerjee et al., 2006).")
