AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100539> "The adult dMP2 ILP7 neurons probably develops rom the embryonic/larval dMP2 ILP7 neurons, though some remodelling occurs (Miguel-Aliaga et al., 2008).")
