AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100581> "FBbt:00100581")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100581> "The existence of this neuroblast is inferred from lineage data (Pereanu et al., 2011; Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006). These papers study secondary neuroblast divisions. Although all of these lineages will correspond to a lineage from a known primary neuroblast lineage, only some will correspond to lineages from the secondary neuroblast division. Boone and Doe, (2008), identify this neuroblast as a type II neuroblast based on the progeny's axon projections that bifurcate over the medial lobe of the mushroom body before crossing the midline.")
