AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00100735> "The existence of this neuroblast is inferred from lineage data (Pereanu et al., 2011; Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006). These papers study secondary neuroblast divisions. Although all of these lineages will correspond to a lineage from a known primary neuroblast lineage, only some will correspond to lineages from the secondary neuroblast division.")
