AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110016> "This neuron was directly shown to be olfactory by electrophysiological recordings of a single neuron (Benton et al, 2009).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0187906") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0206496") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0215822") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110017> " Ipsilateral olfactory receptor neuron that expresses the ionotropic glutamate receptors (Ir) 75d (FBgn0036829) and the co-receptor Ir25a (FBgn0031634). It innervates the antennal lobe glomerulus VL1 (Silbering et al., 2011). Its dendrite transduces signals from the antennal coeloconic sensillum ac4. It is distinguishable from Ir75d ac1 and Ir75d ac2 by its odor response profile (Benton et al., 2009).")
