AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0084361") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110026> "Dorsal-most and largest chamber of the sacculus of the antenna. It has a ventral and a dorsal compartment, which differ in the type of sensilla they contain. The compartments are separated by a thick cuticular flap that extends lateromedially (Shanbhag et al., 1995).")
