AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110041> "Tachykinin expression was observed by in situ hybridization and immunostaining, with more cells being labelled by in situ hybridization.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0162212") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110042> "Pupal neuron that expresses tachykinin (FBgn0037976), whose cell body is located in the cortex of the antennal lobes (Winther et al., 2003).")
