AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110042> "Tachykinin expression was observed by in situ hybridization and immunostaining at pupal stages P8 and P9, with more cells and stronger labelling obtained being in situ hybridization (Winther et al., 2003).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0162212") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110043> "Adult neuron that expresses tachykinin (FBgn0037976), whose cell body is located in the lateral posterior protocerebrum and that innervates the superior median protocerebrum and the fan-shaped body. One cluster of around 10 cell bodies is found per hemisphere (Winther et al., 2003).")
