AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0213020") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110065> "An intrinsic columnar neuron of the visual system whose cell body is located in the medulla cortex and that has a main projection into the lamina making wide-field arborizations in the distal lamina. These neurons also arborize in the medulla (Hasegawa et al., 2011).")
