AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0213020") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110067> "Transmedullary Y neuron that terminates in lobula layer 4 and lobula plate. It displays arborizations in medulla layers M1, M4, M5, M8, M9 and M10 (Hasegawa et al., 2011).")
