AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110068> "Connectivity inferred from EM reconstructions from a single EM section. The subtype of Tm5 was not specified. The neurotransmitter was assessed in cells labelled with a glutamate Gal4 driver P{GawB}VGlut[OK371] [FBti0076967] (Gao et al., 2008).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0213020") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110069> "Distal medullary amacrine neuron that branches in medulla layers M6, M7 and M8 (Hasegawa et al., 2011).")
