AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110074> "The neurotransmitter was assessed in cells labelled with a glutamate Gal4 driver P{GawB}VGlut[OK371] [FBti0076967] (Gao et al., 2008).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FlyBase:FBrf0212356") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FBbt_00110075> "Transmedullary neuron that terminates in lobula layer 4. It also has arborizations in medulla layers M2, M3, M4 and M9. It is a cholinergic neuron (Varija Raghu et al., 2011).")
